os of doom and destruction based on “Climate Change” have dominated their outlook. Well, their Climate Science has now been debunked, withdrawn, and taken down by the UN IPCC. That’s right, the same organization that published these projections as “settled science” has now determined they are not reliable and have withdrawn them. No more catastrophic predictions. GONE! GONE! GONE! Thank you for your attention to this matter. President DONALD J. TRUMP", "link": "https://www.trumpstruth.org/statuses/43718", "market": false}, {"t": 1795456854, "source": "Truth Social", "title": "Iowa is a very special place to me, a place that I won, by substantial margins, in all three Elections but, whether I won or lost, would never deter me from making a correct decision. As everyone knows, there is a Military “clean up” operation, without which, a very dangerous situation exists. In 2009, the Obama Administration improperly stored a vast number of explosives, and the Experts, who know it well, and have been studying it for many years, feel there is a substantial chance that this material will explode of its own volition, perhaps sometime in the near future. We have an opportunity to do a highly controlled detonation of these dangerous and rapidly corroding materials. The Experts, in particular the United States Military, feel that this approach will be a far safer one than allowing the situation to fester, not knowing when they will detonate by themselves. This operation would, in other words, be a controlled one rather than a large, spontaneous explosion. The weather, right now, is optimal for this planned response to take place. I feel the proper course is to get rid of this longterm problem but, at the same time, have ordered the Military not to do so until such time as the Eighth Circuit agrees that we can go forward, and am further making this decision fully subject to the incoming Governor Elect, Rob Sand, agreeing to the operation. If he or the Courts do not agree, we will 